{"lang":"zh-CN","summary":"Navigation: Agent基础概念MOC","html":"<pre class=\"frontmatter language-yaml\" style=\"display: none; overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-yaml is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token key atrule\">title</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent 按智能水平可以分为哪几类？各有什么特点？\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">type</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> interview\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">topic</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"Agent基础概念\"</span>\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">difficulty</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> fundamental\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">importance</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> medium\n<span class=\"token key atrule\">tags</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> agent/基础概念\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> type/interview\n  <span class=\"token punctuation\">-</span> diff/fundamental</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>Navigation</strong>: <a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a></p>\n<h1 data-heading=\"问题\" dir=\"auto\">问题</h1>\n<p dir=\"auto\">AI Agent 按智能水平（或架构复杂度）可以分为哪几类？每种类型的特点、工作原理和典型应用是什么？</p>\n<h2 data-heading=\"答案\" dir=\"auto\">答案</h2>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Agent 按智能水平从低到高可分为<strong>五类</strong>，体现了从简单规则响应到自主学习决策的技术演进：</p>\n<pre style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\">智能水平递进关系：\n\n简单反射 Agent → 基于模型的反射 Agent → 目标驱动 Agent → 效用驱动 Agent → 学习型 Agent\n     ↑                    ↑                    ↑               ↑              ↑\n   最基础              增加状态记忆          增加规划能力     增加价值评估     增加学习能力\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>类型一：简单反射型 Agent（Simple Reflex Agent）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：基于\"条件-动作\"规则（if-then），直接根据当前感知信息做出反应</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>特点</strong>：无记忆、无状态、即时响应、规则固定</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：确定性环境、简单规则任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>典型</strong>：自动避障机器人、智能家居开关控制、交通信号灯</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">SimpleReflexAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"简单反射型 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> rules<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">dict</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rules <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> rules  <span class=\"token comment\"># 条件-动作规则表</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">act</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"根据当前感知直接返回动作\"\"\"</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">for</span> condition<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> action <span class=\"token keyword\">in</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rules<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>items<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n            <span class=\"token keyword\">if</span> condition<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n                <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> action\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"default_action\"</span>\n\n<span class=\"token comment\"># 示例：扫地机器人规则</span>\nrules <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token punctuation\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>obstacle_ahead<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"turn_right\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>dirt_detected<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"start_cleaning\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> p<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>battery_low<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token string\">\"return_to_dock\"</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span>\n<span class=\"token punctuation\">}</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>类型二：基于模型的反射 Agent（Model-Based Reflex Agent）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：在简单反射基础上维护一个内部世界模型，追踪环境状态</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>特点</strong>：有状态记忆、能处理部分可观察环境</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：需要状态跟踪的场景</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>典型</strong>：自动驾驶汽车（追踪周围车辆位置）、游戏 AI</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">ModelBasedAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"基于模型的反射 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>internal_model <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> WorldModel<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 内部世界模型</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">act</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 更新内部模型</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>internal_model<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>update<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        \n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 基于模型状态决策</span>\n        state <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>internal_model<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_current_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>rules_based_on_state<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>state<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>类型三：目标驱动型 Agent（Goal-Based Agent）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：有明确目标，通过规划和推理选择能达到目标的行动序列</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>特点</strong>：具备规划能力、能展望未来、可处理多步任务</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：需要目标规划的场景</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>典型</strong>：路径规划机器人、任务调度系统、旅行规划 Agent</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">GoalBasedAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"目标驱动型 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> goal<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>goal <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> goal\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>planner <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Planner<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">act</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 制定达成目标的计划</span>\n        plan <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>planner<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>create_plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>goal<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行计划的下一步</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> plan<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>next_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>类型四：效用驱动型 Agent（Utility-Based Agent）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：在目标驱动基础上引入效用函数，评估不同行动的优劣</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>特点</strong>：能权衡多目标、选择最优而非可行方案、处理冲突目标</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：需要优化决策的场景</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>典型</strong>：推荐系统、资源分配系统、金融投资组合管理</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">UtilityBasedAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"效用驱动型 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> utility_function<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>utility_fn <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> utility_function\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">act</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        possible_actions <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>get_possible_actions<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token comment\"># 选择效用最高的行动</span>\n        best_action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">max</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>possible_actions<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> \n                         key<span class=\"token operator\">=</span><span class=\"token keyword\">lambda</span> a<span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>utility_fn<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>a<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> best_action\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>类型五：学习型 Agent（Learning Agent）</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>原理</strong>：能从经验中学习和改进，持续优化决策策略</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>特点</strong>：自适应、持续进化、能从反馈中学习</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>适用</strong>：动态变化环境、需要持续优化的场景</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>典型</strong>：AlphaGo、推荐系统、强化学习游戏 AI</li>\n</ul>\n<pre class=\"language-python\" style=\"overflow-x: hidden !important; padding: 6px 12px 8px !important;\"><code class=\"language-python is-loaded\" style=\"display: block !important; width: 100% !important; min-width: 0px !important; overflow-x: auto !important; white-space: pre !important; overflow-wrap: normal !important; max-width: 100% !important; box-sizing: border-box !important; padding: 4px 0px 2px !important;\"><span class=\"token keyword\">class</span> <span class=\"token class-name\">LearningAgent</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n    <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"学习型 Agent\"\"\"</span>\n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">__init__</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>performance_element <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> PerformanceElement<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>  <span class=\"token comment\"># 执行</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>learning_element <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> LearningElement<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>        <span class=\"token comment\"># 学习</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>critic <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> Critic<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>                           <span class=\"token comment\"># 评估</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>problem_generator <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> ProblemGenerator<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>      <span class=\"token comment\"># 探索</span>\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">act</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span> <span class=\"token operator\">-</span><span class=\"token operator\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"token builtin\">str</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        action <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>performance_element<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>choose_action<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>percept<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        <span class=\"token keyword\">return</span> action\n    \n    <span class=\"token keyword\">def</span> <span class=\"token function\">learn</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">,</span> feedback<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span><span class=\"token punctuation\">:</span>\n        <span class=\"token triple-quoted-string string\">\"\"\"从反馈中学习优化\"\"\"</span>\n        evaluation <span class=\"token operator\">=</span> self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>critic<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>evaluate<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>feedback<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>learning_element<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>improve<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>evaluation<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n        self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>performance_element<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>update<span class=\"token punctuation\">(</span>self<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>learning_element<span class=\"token punctuation\">.</span>knowledge<span class=\"token punctuation\">)</span>\n</code><button class=\"copy-code-button\" aria-label=\"复制代码\" title=\"复制代码\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"svg-icon lucide-copy\"><rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></pre>\n<hr>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><strong>对比总结表：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>记忆</th>\n<th>规划</th>\n<th>学习</th>\n<th>典型应用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>简单反射</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>自动门、避障机器人</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>基于模型</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>自动驾驶状态跟踪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>目标驱动</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>导航软件、任务调度</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>效用驱动</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>❌</td>\n<td>推荐系统、资源优化</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>学习型</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>✅</td>\n<td>AlphaGo、智能客服</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<h2 data-heading=\"延伸追问\" dir=\"auto\">延伸追问</h2>\n<ol>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：LLM-based Agent 属于哪一类？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：LLM-based Agent 通常是<strong>目标驱动 + 学习型</strong>的混合体，具备规划能力和一定的从上下文学习中适应的能力。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\">\n<p><strong>追问</strong>：实际应用中如何选择 Agent 类型？</p>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>答</strong>：根据环境复杂度、任务确定性、实时性要求和可用资源综合选择。简单确定环境用反射型，复杂动态环境用学习型。</li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 data-heading=\"常见误区\" dir=\"auto\">常见误区</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>误区</strong>：所有 Agent 都需要学习能力</li>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><strong>纠正</strong>：简单规则明确的场景（如工业控制）使用反射型 Agent 更可靠、更高效</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1 data-heading=\"中级篇\" dir=\"auto\">中级篇</h1>\n<hr>\n<h2 data-heading=\"相关\" dir=\"auto\">相关</h2>\n<ul>\n<li dir=\"auto\"><a data-href=\"%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" href=\"/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B/%E5%A4%A7%E6%A8%A1%E5%9E%8B%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95/%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-%E9%9D%A2%E8%AF%95%E9%A2%98%E9%9B%86/01-Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5/Agent%E5%9F%BA%E7%A1%80%E6%A6%82%E5%BF%B5MOC/\" class=\"internal-link\" target=\"\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Agent基础概念MOC</a> — 返回主题导航</li>\n</ul>","headings":[]}